{"id":"Wd49ca735c3fe9fa569442dba","zh":"不利波长","en":"","name":"不利波长","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wd49ca735c3fe9fa569442dba","text":"不利波长","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S9c18e5c2bddea0f393e8","source_id":"P109","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"关于轨道不平顺不利波长、波长动力效应及融合轨道不平顺波长动力特性的线路管理方法的研究,已引起国内外研究者的广泛关注。","citations":[{"source_id":"P109","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sbd922ae89270b9b73f01","source_id":"P109","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"上述研究表明轨道不平顺波长在铁路线路动力分析及维修管理中具有重要意义,对轨道不平顺不利波长进行有效控制与消除是一个亟待解决的问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P109","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S0a6db8782573af9b7b99","source_id":"P124","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"1.3 车体垂向和水平振动加速度功率谱分析通过对车体振动加速度功率谱的分析,可以获得各线路相应于车体垂、横向振动的不利波长成分及相对幅值大小 [9]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P124","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S81b6fd05f7e75a4d6fe4","source_id":"P124","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"长波不平顺的影响主要体现在车体振动上,因此,通过车体加速度作为确定不利波长的评定指标之一是有科学依据的,本文采用相干分析与功率谱分析相结合的方法来比较真实地确定轨道随机不平顺的不利波长范围。","citations":[{"source_id":"P124","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P109":{"id":"P109","title":"铁路轨道不平顺波长及病害波形的定位方法","authors":"徐磊,高建敏,翟婉明,陈宪麦","year":"2017","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2017.11.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-localization-methods-for-track-irregularity-wavelengths-and-track-diseases"},"P124":{"id":"P124","title":"高速铁路( 京沪、沪宁、沪杭线) 轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,徐伟昌,董连成","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.04.001","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-spectrum-for-high-speed-railway-beijing-shanghai-shanghai-hangzhou-an"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"与较明显车体振动联系的轨道不平顺波长或波段。","language":"zh","source_id":"P124","paper_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-spectrum-for-high-speed-railway-beijing-shanghai-shanghai-hangzhou-an","title":"高速铁路（京沪、沪宁、沪杭线）轨道不平顺谱分析","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"对车辆与线路动力相互作用产生不利影响的波长，构成定位研究的工程动机。","language":"zh","source_id":"P109","paper_slug":"2017-localization-methods-for-track-irregularity-wavelengths-and-track-diseases","title":"铁路轨道不平顺波长及病害波形的定位方法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wb2f06b77b0707b9fb0f532ef","name":"detrimental wavelength","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wb2f06b77b0707b9fb0f532ef","name":"detrimental wavelength","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wb2f06b77b0707b9fb0f532ef","name":"detrimental wavelength","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P124","title":"高速铁路( 京沪、沪宁、沪杭线) 轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,徐伟昌,董连成","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.04.001","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-spectrum-for-high-speed-railway-beijing-shanghai-shanghai-hangzhou-an"},{"id":"P109","title":"铁路轨道不平顺波长及病害波形的定位方法","authors":"徐磊,高建敏,翟婉明,陈宪麦","year":"2017","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2017.11.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-localization-methods-for-track-irregularity-wavelengths-and-track-diseases"}]}